* Explicit RC state realizations of derived compensators. Leakage pole 0.01 rad/s.
.subckt CTRL_A ea ca 0
BintA 0 ia I=10.4593927209*V(ea)
CintA ia 0 1 IC=0
RleakA ia 0 100
BbufferA ba 0 V=V(ia)
RfilterA ba fa 5.30516476973e-05
CfilterA fa 0 1 IC=0
BcompA ca 0 V=7.17383307414*V(ia)+(1-7.17383307414)*V(fa)
.ends CTRL_A
.subckt CTRL_B eb cb 0
BintB 0 ib I=1661.90546898*V(eb)
CintB ib 0 1 IC=0
RleakB ib 0 100
BbufferB bb 0 V=V(ib)
RfilterB bb fb 3.9788735773e-06
CfilterB fb 0 1 IC=0
BleadB lb 0 V=6.18140633065*V(ib)+(1-6.18140633065)*V(fb)
RfilterC lb fc 1.98943678865e-06
CfilterC fc 0 1 IC=0
BcompB cb 0 V=12.3628126613*V(lb)+(1-12.3628126613)*V(fc)
.ends CTRL_B
